<title>FINLAND: HANSAPANK JAN-SEPT GROUP PROFIT UP 37 PCT.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK JAN-SEPT GROUP PROFIT UP 37 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian bank Hansapank said in a statement on Wednesday the group's January-September net profit rose 37 percent year-on-year to 169 million Estonian kroons.</p>
<p>Hansapank said on October 8 the bank's net profit alone rose 25 percent year-on-year in January-September to 128.2 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
